# CQ-P05, the companion of CQ-P04: Does any party, item or record stand in owl:sameAs with another?
# A constraint: identity is stated by an identity decision, never by owl:sameAs (decision 34), so the answer passes
# when it is false. A thing the same as itself is no answer. It reads no type, so it has no step to walk.
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>

ASK { ?x owl:sameAs ?y . FILTER (?x != ?y) }
